#: misago/admin/categories/forms.py:140
msgctxt "admin category form"
msgid ""
"Vanilla categories behave like categories in \"vanilla\" forum software: "
"users can't post threads directly in them. They are also displayed "
"differently in the UI. Vanilla categories must have at least one visible "
"subcategory to be shown to users."
msgstr ""
"容器版块的行为类似于传统论坛软件中的分类：用户无法直接在其中发布主题，界面显"
"示方式也有所不同。容器版块必须至少有一个可见的子版块才会显示给用户。"

#: misago/admin/categories/forms.py:146
msgctxt "admin category form"
msgid "Include threads from child categories on threads list"
msgstr "在主题列表中包含子版块的主题"

#: misago/admin/categories/forms.py:151
msgctxt "admin category form"
